	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 四半世紀の時を経て幻の大将軍「真駆参大将軍」が遂にLEGENDBBで登場！",
			"• 先祖である真悪参の鎧が付属し、BB戦士オリジナルの設定である先祖の鎧を装着した姿が再現できる！",
			"• オリジナルギミックである龍馬凰形態への変形も可能！",
			"• 双刃剣、斬鳳剣、三叉の槍、戦武面など豊富な武装が付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• After a quarter of a century, the phantom general \"Shinkokusan Taishogun\" finally appears in LEGENDBB!",
			"• The armor of the ancestor Shinakusan is included, allowing you to recreate the appearance wearing the armor of the ancestor set in the BB Senshi original!",
			"• Can also be transformed into the original gimmick Ryomaou form!",
			"• Comes with a variety of weapons such as a double-edged sword, Zanhoken, trident spear, and battle mask!"
		]
	},
